{
  "name": "status-lists",
  "description": "Status-list bits of the gateway's DID-document vector set, produced by the gateway's status-list service (identity-gateway/src/m4/status-lists.ts) and decoded from its signed lists. Index i of an identifier comes from the ledger order of its first mint (30 confirmations); it is in list floor(i / 131072) at position i mod 131072. Token Status List (2 bits, entry 0 in the least significant bits of byte 0): 0 valid (Active), 1 invalid (Revoked or Retired), 2 suspended. Bitstring Status List (bit 0 is the most significant bit of byte 0): the revocation bit at position p, the suspension bit at 131072 + p. The *Bytes members are the uncompressed bytes that hold the indexed entries of list 0.",
  "specification": "docs/IDENTITY_REGISTRY.md §8.4, §8.6; docs/did-vector-method.md §7.3",
